            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Smart city Application is build to help residents of our city to take better care of their enivroment, connect with more people and express their issues and concernes about city. City Events helps residents to connects each others and also to make their city a better place. Recycling Tracker helps raising the awerness to residents about Recycling. City issue helps resident to report issues in town which help maintian safe enviroment for everyone."/>
